# Settings > Date & Time > Time zone (the zone picker), in a release build (APPLAUNCH_DEV=0). The board starts on
# Etc/UTC (an OS installed without a zone) with Network Time on. Date & Time lists Time zone last, its zone in green
# and a chevron; the picker's level 1 lists the regions (a chevron each) and UTC (checked: in use); America opens its
# zones without the region ("Argentina/Buenos_Aires"); a refused change (timedated fails, then PolicyKit refuses and
# this process has no sudo service) says why in the status line and stays; the change done goes back to Date & Time,
# whose row shows the new zone, and the status clock moves at once (20:30 UTC -> 17:30); opened again, America shows
# its city and the zone is checked and centred; Esc goes up one level, then out; Network Time is still on and toggles
# off without touching the zone; Date & Time > Info shows the new offset; the home grid's clock is in the new zone;
# then Europe > Paris from the home grid again (a short name: whole on the row; the clock at 22:30). A long name ends
# with dots on the row where it does not fit (the label keeps at least a third of it); the picker shows it whole.
# Review only: no golden; the headers before the change are checked against the home grid's (run.sh header; after
# it the clock differs on purpose). Fixtures: `tz ZONE`, `tzset ok|fail|denied`, fixtures/timezones.txt
# (src/harness_stubs.cpp).
title settings native time zone
review
sizes 320x170 480x320 640x480 1280x800
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-10-10
wifi 70
bt on
ntp on
tz Etc/UTC
tzset ok
home
header home
shot tz_home_utc
launch Settings
# root: Up from Screen wraps to System, Up again is Date & Time
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
# Info, Network Time, Set Manually, Time zone: Up from Info wraps to Time zone
key UP
wait 300
shot tz_row
@480x320,640x480,1280x800 header tz_row "Settings > Date & Time" "Date & Time" Time
key ENTER
wait 1200
shot tz_regions
@480x320,640x480,1280x800 header tz_regions "Settings > Date & Time > Time zone" "Date & Time > Time zone" "Time zone"
# Down from UTC wraps to Africa, then America
key DOWN
key DOWN
wait 300
shot tz_regions_america
key ENTER
wait 600
shot tz_america
@480x320,640x480,1280x800 header tz_america "Settings > Date & Time > Time zone > America" "Date & Time > Time zone > America" "Time zone > America" America
# Adak, Anchorage, Anguilla, Antigua, Araguaina, Argentina/Buenos_Aires
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
wait 300
shot tz_buenos_aires
# timedated fails: the reason, the list stays
tzset fail
key ENTER
wait 900
shot tz_failed
# PolicyKit refuses: the sudo path, absent in the harness, is refused too
tzset denied
key ENTER
wait 900
shot tz_denied
# done: back on Date & Time with the new zone, the status clock at 17:30
tzset ok
key ENTER
wait 900
shot tz_applied
# again: America selected with its city, then the zone checked and centred
key ENTER
wait 1200
shot tz_regions_again
key ENTER
wait 600
shot tz_america_again
# Esc: up one level, then back to Date & Time
key ESC
wait 300
shot tz_back_regions
key ESC
wait 300
shot tz_back_section
# Network Time is still on; switched off, the zone stays
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 900
shot tz_ntp_off
# Date & Time > Info: the new local time and offset
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1200
shot tz_info
# home: the status clock in the new zone
key ESC
key ESC
key ESC
wait 900
shot tz_home_after
# again from the home grid: the common case, Europe > Paris (the 37th zone of Europe); the clock moves to 22:30
launch Settings
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1200
# America (selected) .. Antarctica, Arctic, Asia, Atlantic, Australia, Europe
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
wait 300
shot tz_paris
key ENTER
wait 900
shot tz_paris_row
